# Daily Systems

Daily Reward:
- repeating 7-day calendar;
- missed day does not reset calendar.
- D1 100 Coins
- D2 125
- D3 150
- D4 1 Hint
- D5 175
- D6 200
- D7 300 + 1 Hint

Daily Streak:
- missed day breaks streak.
- 3d 100 Coins
- 7d 250
- 14d 400
- 30d 750

Daily Challenge:
- deterministic board per cohort;
- unlimited retries;
- 150 Coins;
- reward first completion only;
- reset 00:00 validated player-local timezone;
- backend authoritative.

Launch notifications:
- Daily Challenge.
- Streak Risk.
- quiet hours 22:00–09:00 local.

Do not implement Post-MVP Packs/Leaderboards/XP/Achievements without explicit approval.
